# StarDome logo

The official mark is the chrome **StarDome** wordmark (`SD_Logo1.png`).

- Web UI, header, footer, login: `public/SD_Logo1.webp` (PNG sibling `public/SD_Logo1.png`).
- PDF / PNG fallback: `public/SD_Logo1.png` (and `public/SW3.png` as the same mark).
- Favicon / Apple: the star from the D — `public/favicon.ico`, `public/favicon-16.png`, `public/favicon-32.png`, `public/apple-touch-icon.png`. App Router copies: `src/app/icon.png`, `src/app/apple-icon.png`.
- Open Graph / link previews: `public/og-starwall.jpg` and `src/app/opengraph-image.jpg`.

Regenerate with `node scripts/optimize-logo.mjs <source.png>` from the official `SD_Logo1` artwork.

- Do not redraw the wordmark in CSS or SVG.
- Do not generate a replacement logo.
- Do not switch to another mark.
